# Deploy only when asked

Do not run `wrangler deploy`, `vinext-cloudflare deploy`, production publishes, or any live deploy from this machine after a code change.

Deploy only when the user explicitly says to deploy (or «деплой», «выложи», «залей на прод»).

Pushing `alxgntv/seenshot-web` branch `main` deploys production via GitHub Actions. Do not push that branch unless the user asked to ship the site.

After a push to that branch, follow verify-github-actions-deploy.

Local `vinext dev` / `wrangler dev` is not a deploy. Do not treat a finished edit as a reason to ship.
